                <head>Appendix 312</head>
                <p>[Here is omitted a report submitted by the French delegates, November 22, 1919,
                    relative to trade restrictions in various European countries. The report
                    consists principally of long lists of the specific articles affected by the
                    import or export regulations of the countries treated.]</p>
            </div>
